<title>JAPAN: Olympus Optical jumps on earnings report.</title>
<headline>Olympus Optical jumps on earnings report.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Olympus Optical Co Ltd's shares jumped on Wednesday due to a newspaper report which predicted that the firm would post robust earnings in the 1997/98 business year, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0426 GMT, the shares were up 50 yen at 1,110.</p>
